{
    "title": "Bridebook - Wedding Planner",
    "description": "Just got engaged and have no idea how to plan a wedding? Let\u2019s fix that! Bridebook is the wedding planner in your pocket, where you can manage your to-do list, budget, guest list, search for venues and much more.\r\n\r\nFrom wedding planning checklists to the easiest way to organise your guest list, we\u2019ve got \u201ceverything you need to plan your dream wedding\u201d (<i>Brides Magazine</i>). There\u2019s a reason why we\u2019re \u201cthe highest rated wedding app in the world\u201d (<i>Telegraph</i>). Join the 1.9 million couples have already ditched their spreadsheets and download Bridebook! Bride, groom or in between, we\u2019ve got you covered. \r\n\r\n<b>Plan with your partner</b>\r\nLink your account with your partner so you can plan your wedding on the app together. Assign tasks to each other using your shared Checklist, manage your Guest List together from separate devices, or even add another family member to help out with your wedding planning.\r\n\r\n<b>Count down the days</b>\r\nTrack the days until you tie the knot! As soon as you enter your wedding date, we\u2019ll create your wedding countdown. You can even personalize your Bridebook countdown with photographs to truly make it your own!\r\n\r\n<b>Find your dream venue</b>\r\nWhatever wedding venue you\u2019ve been dreaming of and wherever it is, you\u2019ll be able to find it on Bridebook. From castles and country houses to warehouses and barns, our worldwide venue directory has it all. Search the best wedding venues, save your favourites for later, and contact your top picks directly. You\u2019ll make your dream wedding reception a reality in no time.\r\n\r\n<b>Book your destination wedding</b>\r\nEver dreamed of a wedding across the globe? Discover a world of stunning venues, all from the comfort of your home. Communicate directly with venues through Bridebook, making your overseas wedding planning effortless and enjoyable. Planning a destination wedding has never been easier!\r\n\r\n<b>Track your to-do list</b>\r\nOnce you\u2019ve unlocked your personalized Checklist, you\u2019ll never worry about missing a thing again. We\u2019ll tell you exactly what to do and when to do it \u2014 and if something\u2019s missing, you can add custom tasks too. Wedding planning\u2019s never been so easy! \r\n\r\n<b>Manage your guests</b>\r\nIntroducing the world\u2019s easiest on-the-go Guest List manager where you can keep track of RSVPs, +1s, dietary requirements and much more. We\u2019ve even got a handy tool that lets you collect all your guests\u2019 contact details in one click! \r\n\r\n<b>Keep your spending under control</b>\r\nWith Bridebook\u2019s Budget Calculator, you never need to worry about going over budget! Just let us know how much you\u2019ve got to spend and our powerful algorithms will do all the heavy lifting to break down your wedding budget based on your preferences and thousands of couples\u2019 actual spending.\r\n\r\n<b>Get inspired by our team of experts</b>\r\nWe\u2019ve spoken to the best in the business to get you insider tips and expert advice on every aspect of your wedding planning. Whether you\u2019re wondering how to start your guest list, looking for some sneaky cost saving tips or after a few ideas for DIY decorations, we\u2019ve got you covered. We bring to brides, grooms and anyone in between the most up-to-date advice. \r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Tie the knot in your dream venue. Together, we\u2019ll have your wedding organized quicker than you can say, \u201cI do!\u201d. \r\n\r\n<i>Read the Privacy Policy here:\r\nhttps://bridebook.com/global/privacy-policy</i>",
    "descriptionHTML": "Just got engaged and have no idea how to plan a wedding? Let\u2019s fix that! Bridebook is the wedding planner in your pocket, where you can manage your to-do list, budget, guest list, search for venues and much more.<br><br>From wedding planning checklists to the easiest way to organise your guest list, we\u2019ve got \u201ceverything you need to plan your dream wedding\u201d (<i>Brides Magazine</i>). There\u2019s a reason why we\u2019re \u201cthe highest rated wedding app in the world\u201d (<i>Telegraph</i>). Join the 1.9 million couples have already ditched their spreadsheets and download Bridebook! Bride, groom or in between, we\u2019ve got you covered. <br><br><b>Plan with your partner</b><br>Link your account with your partner so you can plan your wedding on the app together. Assign tasks to each other using your shared Checklist, manage your Guest List together from separate devices, or even add another family member to help out with your wedding planning.<br><br><b>Count down the days</b><br>Track the days until you tie the knot! As soon as you enter your wedding date, we\u2019ll create your wedding countdown. You can even personalize your Bridebook countdown with photographs to truly make it your own!<br><br><b>Find your dream venue</b><br>Whatever wedding venue you\u2019ve been dreaming of and wherever it is, you\u2019ll be able to find it on Bridebook. From castles and country houses to warehouses and barns, our worldwide venue directory has it all. Search the best wedding venues, save your favourites for later, and contact your top picks directly. You\u2019ll make your dream wedding reception a reality in no time.<br><br><b>Book your destination wedding</b><br>Ever dreamed of a wedding across the globe? Discover a world of stunning venues, all from the comfort of your home. Communicate directly with venues through Bridebook, making your overseas wedding planning effortless and enjoyable. Planning a destination wedding has never been easier!<br><br><b>Track your to-do list</b><br>Once you\u2019ve unlocked your personalized Checklist, you\u2019ll never worry about missing a thing again. We\u2019ll tell you exactly what to do and when to do it \u2014 and if something\u2019s missing, you can add custom tasks too. Wedding planning\u2019s never been so easy! <br><br><b>Manage your guests</b><br>Introducing the world\u2019s easiest on-the-go Guest List manager where you can keep track of RSVPs, +1s, dietary requirements and much more. We\u2019ve even got a handy tool that lets you collect all your guests\u2019 contact details in one click! <br><br><b>Keep your spending under control</b><br>With Bridebook\u2019s Budget Calculator, you never need to worry about going over budget! Just let us know how much you\u2019ve got to spend and our powerful algorithms will do all the heavy lifting to break down your wedding budget based on your preferences and thousands of couples\u2019 actual spending.<br><br><b>Get inspired by our team of experts</b><br>We\u2019ve spoken to the best in the business to get you insider tips and expert advice on every aspect of your wedding planning. Whether you\u2019re wondering how to start your guest list, looking for some sneaky cost saving tips or after a few ideas for DIY decorations, we\u2019ve got you covered. We bring to brides, grooms and anyone in between the most up-to-date advice. <br><br>What are you waiting for? Tie the knot in your dream venue. Together, we\u2019ll have your wedding organized quicker than you can say, \u201cI do!\u201d. <br><br><i>Read the Privacy Policy here:<br>https://bridebook.com/global/privacy-policy</i>",
